<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Petrobras Q1 net profit down.</title>
<headline>Brazil Petrobras Q1 net profit down.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state oil monopoly Petrobras posted the following first quarter results, calculated according to Brazilian Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (GAAP).</p>
<p>			   Jan-March 1997	   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Net			 72 million			 79 million</p>
<p>    Net revenues	  4.13 bln		     3.84 bln</p>
<p>Note: All figures in Brazilian reais. The company said it increased oil production nine percent in the first quarter in comparison with the same period last year.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
</text>
